WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:12.100
The Bible is a series of books written edited and assembled over thousands of years

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.320
It contains the most influential stories of mankind

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:24.320
Knowledge of these stories is essential to a deep understanding of western Culture, which is in turn vital to proper psychological health

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:28.580
(as human beings are cultural animals ) and societal stability.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:34.020
These stories are neither history, as we commonly conceived it, nor empirical science.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:38.780
Instead they are investigations into the structure of Being itself

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.440
and calls to action within that Being.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:44.400
They have deep psychological significance

